# The box's memory (CLACKA-192): Up recalls the messages sent, Ctrl+R
# finds one in the finder, and a queued message comes back to edit with
# Up, or its pencil.
size 1100x900
keys <C-;>:Agent claude<CR>
keys i
type Fix the failing tests in crates/gui.
keys <CR>
wait-for echo: Fix the failing tests
type Then update the docs
keys <S-CR>
type and add a NEWS line.
keys <CR>
wait-for echo: Then update the docs
keys <Up>
sleep 300
shot recall-newest
keys <Up><Up>
sleep 300
shot recall-older
keys <Down><Down>
sleep 300
shot recall-back-to-empty
keys <C-r>
sleep 300
shot recall-finder
type failing
sleep 300
shot recall-finder-narrowed
keys <CR>
sleep 300
shot recall-picked
keys <C-a><BS>
type wait
keys <CR>
sleep 300
type Review the tests after this turn.
keys <CR>
sleep 300
shot queue-with-pencil
keys <Up>
sleep 500
shot queue-taken-back
type  And the lint.
sleep 300
shot queue-edited
